    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llSetTimerEvent(float Rate);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="removed-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Removed from Lua. It can be used in the llcompat library</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Cause the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Timer" target="_blank">timer</a> event to be triggered a maximum of once every <b>sec</b> seconds. Passing in 0.0 stops further timer events.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Rate / sec</td>
          <td>Any positive non-zero value to enable, zero (0.0) to disable.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
